# Commits

Only commit when the user asks. The subject says what changed and why, in plain language, one or two sentences.

Never add Cursor to a commit. That includes `Made with Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, and any Cursor trailer.

```
# Bad
fix navbar

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

# Good
Move the account menu to the right and open notifications from the bell.

The bell was sending people into Messages, and the name sat beside the search.
```
